    Bug 2006844 - Implement SaveMessageToDisk for EWS. r=edicharry


    Most of this is reusing the save-to-disk specific `nsIStreamListener` used by
    the `nsMsgMailNewsUrl` code, and tweaking it so it's both still usable by it and
    also usable by other protocols such as EWS.

